<title>UK: IADB SETS $200 MILLION THREE-YEAR EUROBOND.</title>
<headline>IADB SETS $200 MILLION THREE-YEAR EUROBOND.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager SBC Warburg.</p>
<p> BORROWER   INTER-AMERICAN DEVELOPMENT BANK</p>
<p> AMT	  $200 MLN  COUPON     6.00	MATURITY    22.AUG.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.8975  PAY DATE    22.AUG.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.375     REOFFER    99.71     SPREAD	ZERO</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/GB</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  HOME CTRY  SUPRA     TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.1875    SELL CONC  1.1875    PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 6.00 PCT U.S. T-NOTE DUE 15.AUG.00</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
